00:00:00,010 --> 00:00:58,930
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

1
00:00:59,236 --> 00:01:04,097
[Apocalypse Log 6]

2
00:04:48,916 --> 00:04:50,900
Where am I?

3
00:04:54,458 --> 00:04:56,192
I'm okay.

4
00:04:58,541 --> 00:05:00,275
Lie.

5
00:05:27,467 --> 00:05:28,925
Are you feeling better?

6
00:05:28,925 --> 00:05:31,508
Back to causing trouble already?

7
00:05:31,508 --> 00:05:34,117
I just wanted to get some water.

8
00:05:50,800 --> 00:05:51,883
Lin Zai.

9
00:05:51,883 --> 00:05:54,617
Don't you know what you're allergic to?

10
00:05:55,342 --> 00:05:57,717
How was I supposed to know
I'd be allergic to that fruit?

11
00:05:57,717 --> 00:06:00,200
Besides, I didn't want to suffer like this.

12
00:06:02,633 --> 00:06:06,467
Because of you, we've wasted a lot of time.

13
00:06:06,467 --> 00:06:08,633
If you continue to defy me,

14
00:06:08,633 --> 00:06:12,883
I guarantee you'll be the one
who suffers in the end.

15
00:06:12,883 --> 00:06:15,300
So, now you think I'm a nuisance?

16
00:06:15,300 --> 00:06:17,250
If you hadn't taken me away,
none of this would have happened.

17
00:06:17,250 --> 00:06:19,633
Lin Zai.

18
00:06:19,633 --> 00:06:22,450
I only need to ensure you're alive.

19
00:06:24,342 --> 00:06:27,967
Don't force me to use
the methods I use on others...

20
00:06:27,967 --> 00:06:30,075
on you.

21
00:09:05,383 --> 00:09:06,500
It's not safe here.

22
00:09:06,500 --> 00:09:08,608
We need to leave quickly.

23
00:09:17,425 --> 00:09:19,425
That's a mutated zombie, right?

24
00:09:19,425 --> 00:09:22,758
It's so huge. If we run into it,
not even a god could save us.

25
00:09:22,758 --> 00:09:25,008
That's right. It's a Class A zombie.

26
00:09:25,008 --> 00:09:27,283
Ordinary methods can't kill them.

27
00:09:36,508 --> 00:09:37,592
Fine, tie me up if you want.

28
00:09:37,592 --> 00:09:39,008
But what is this for?

29
00:09:39,008 --> 00:09:41,925
To stop you from eating things
you shouldn't again.

30
00:09:41,925 --> 00:09:43,458
I promise I won't.

31
00:09:43,458 --> 00:09:45,858
Besides, I didn't get an allergy on purpose.

32
00:09:47,292 --> 00:09:49,651
It hurts when you tie me like this.

33
00:09:52,050 --> 00:09:53,758
Hey!

34
00:09:53,758 --> 00:09:55,258
You're doing this for revenge, aren't you?

35
00:09:55,258 --> 00:09:57,825
Do you think this will make me obedient?

36
00:09:58,458 --> 00:10:00,358
We'll see about that.

37
00:10:18,717 --> 00:10:20,658
What now?

38
00:10:24,883 --> 00:10:26,700
What are you doing?

39
00:11:27,883 --> 00:11:30,158
You don't want biscuits or meat?

40
00:11:32,092 --> 00:11:34,908
I'd rather die than eat your food.

41
00:11:35,625 --> 00:11:37,092
Lin Zai.

42
00:11:37,092 --> 00:11:39,700
Are you treating my words as a joke?

43
00:11:53,092 --> 00:11:54,783
Let go.

44
00:11:56,050 --> 00:11:58,658
Do you enjoy being a dog that much?

45
00:12:05,925 --> 00:12:09,117
Taming a dog that bites is simple.

46
00:12:11,383 --> 00:12:14,700
You just have to pull out its fangs.

47
00:12:19,467 --> 00:12:21,217
Lin Zai.

48
00:12:21,217 --> 00:12:24,050
I'll say this one last time.

49
00:12:24,050 --> 00:12:26,950
Eat properly.

50
00:12:33,967 --> 00:12:35,758
This is the last time I'll indulge you.

51
00:12:35,758 --> 00:12:37,300
I'll say it again.

52
00:12:37,300 --> 00:12:40,367
My only job is to bring you back alive.

53
00:12:42,758 --> 00:12:45,300
If you don't want to eat,

54
00:12:45,300 --> 00:12:49,575
then I'll use my own methods to make you eat.

55
00:13:32,167 --> 00:13:35,067
Are you planning to sit there all night?

56
00:14:30,542 --> 00:14:32,258
It's so cold.

57
00:14:32,258 --> 00:14:34,450
Why is there a draft everywhere?

58
00:17:07,000 --> 00:17:09,067
You're not tying me up?

59
00:17:10,175 --> 00:17:13,367
There's no need. You can't run away anyway.

60
00:17:30,417 --> 00:17:31,633
Hey.

61
00:17:31,633 --> 00:17:34,417
You're taking me back, and then what?

62
00:17:34,417 --> 00:17:36,008
What will happen to me?

63
00:17:36,008 --> 00:17:38,758
And what do you get out of it?

64
00:17:38,758 --> 00:17:40,925
Don't ask questions you shouldn't.

65
00:17:40,925 --> 00:17:43,092
Will I die?

66
00:17:43,092 --> 00:17:45,908
You're the first immune
our organization has found.

67
00:17:47,258 --> 00:17:49,217
What will you do to me?

68
00:17:49,217 --> 00:17:52,408
You won't cut me open, will you?

69
00:17:53,258 --> 00:17:55,825
That's not within my scope of duty.

70
00:17:58,175 --> 00:18:00,133
When that day comes,

71
00:18:00,133 --> 00:18:02,575
you won't care if I live or die, right?

72
00:18:06,550 --> 00:18:09,200
You'll have to survive until then first.

73
00:18:11,342 --> 00:18:13,033
Stay close to me.

74
00:18:15,958 --> 00:18:18,525
I don't have a choice anyway.

75
00:18:25,300 --> 00:18:26,300
Guang Qi.

76
00:18:26,300 --> 00:18:27,675
<i>I am here.</i>

77
00:18:27,675 --> 00:18:29,925
Do experiments on the zombie virus

78
00:18:29,925 --> 00:18:32,330
cause harm to the immune body?

79
00:18:32,330 --> 00:18:33,500
<i>I'm sorry.</i>

80
00:18:33,500 --> 00:18:36,247
<i>You do not have the authority
to query this question.</i>

81
00:18:43,008 --> 00:18:44,825
Lie.

82
00:18:50,842 --> 00:18:51,843
Look.

83
00:18:51,843 --> 00:18:54,717
This boar looks much tastier than a rabbit.

84
00:18:54,717 --> 00:18:57,200
If we catch it,
it'll last us for several meals.

85
00:19:08,917 --> 00:19:11,158
Lie, a zombie!

86
00:19:14,958 --> 00:19:16,092
Ouch!

87
00:19:16,092 --> 00:19:19,408
Wait, don't kill me! I'm human!

88
00:19:29,675 --> 00:19:31,883
You weren't bitten by a zombie, were you?

89
00:19:31,883 --> 00:19:33,167
No.

90
00:19:33,167 --> 00:19:36,133
I disguised myself as a zombie to go hunting.

91
00:19:36,133 --> 00:19:39,667
I haven't eaten in days.

92
00:19:39,667 --> 00:19:43,008
I finally spotted a wild boar.

93
00:19:43,008 --> 00:19:46,758
I'm sorry. I thought you were a zombie.

94
00:19:46,758 --> 00:19:49,117
My friend didn't do it on purpose.

95
00:19:54,050 --> 00:19:57,050
Your wound needs to be treated quickly.

96
00:19:57,050 --> 00:19:59,300
Do you have a camp? We'll take you back.

97
00:19:59,300 --> 00:20:01,633
Yes. My camp is nearby.

98
00:20:01,633 --> 00:20:03,450
I'm counting on you.

99
00:20:08,300 --> 00:20:10,633
This was a mistake on both our parts.

100
00:20:10,633 --> 00:20:14,033
We can't just leave him here
to fend for himself.

101
00:20:16,133 --> 00:20:19,450
Don't worry. It won't take much time.

102
00:20:24,333 --> 00:20:25,672
Thank you.

